msgid ""
"Explore Harbor Town with Axel and Alma. Walk along the canal, take the tram "
"or drive a tow truck to help a neighbour. You choose where to go next."
msgstr ""
"Tutustu Harbor Towniin Axelin ja Alman kanssa. Kävele kanavan varrella, "
"hyppää ratikkaan tai auta naapuria hinausautolla. Sinä päätät, minne lähdet "
"seuraavaksi."

msgid ""
"My name is Daniel Nylander. I made this game for my children, who have "
"autism and a language disorder. I wanted them to have a town they could "
"explore at their own pace. That is why you can choose a vehicle by its "
"picture and read what people say in speech bubbles."
msgstr ""
"Olen Daniel Nylander. Tein tämän pelin lapsilleni, joilla on autismi ja "
"kielellinen häiriö. Halusin antaa heille kaupungin, jota he voisivat tutkia "
"omaan tahtiinsa. Siksi voit valita ajoneuvon sen kuvaa napauttamalla ja "
"lukea puhekuplista, mitä ihmiset sanovat."

